# Rasputin Dreamweaver enters with seven dream counters (CR 614.1c, 122.6) and two dream counters come off it for {C}{C}
# (CR 605.1a, 118.3): five. Turn 3 began with it untapped, so its upkeep ability puts one on it: six (CR 603.4). It
